    "title": "Sylow cosets in $S_6$ and three-element subsets",
    "full_tex": "Let $F\\subseteq\\Sp(4,2)\\cong S_6$. If every subset of $F$ with at most three elements lies in a right coset $Pg$ of a Sylow $2$-subgroup $P$, then so does $F$.\n"
  },
